        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "滴 counts drops of liquid. It measures the liquid quantity rather than the container.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "杯子里只有一滴水。",
                "pinyin": "bēizi lǐ zhǐyǒu yī dī shuǐ 。",
                "meaning": "There is only one drop of water in the cup.",
                "audio": "bc0d838b506da2def1617573311af3ae523b9a22bea96021ceca98846fa42b45"
              },
              {
                "text": "他流了两滴眼泪。",
                "pinyin": "tā liú le liǎng dī yǎnlèi 。",
                "meaning": "He shed two tears.",
